that the reader owns. Copies must keep this paragraph. The authors keep all
other rights. Nothing here grants a patent license. Nothing here limits the
fair use of the work. Disputes go to the courts of the authors' home town.
These terms are the authors' own and are not one of the well known licenses.
Read them again before you rely on them, because they are not a standard text.
